CHANGELOG
---------
# 1.0.0 (2020-12-28)
First release of Blackbody. The most important features are:

* Loading FLIR thermograms from many cameras
* Loading single-band TIFFs assumed to be in °C
* Rendering to many different colors palettes, including inferno and turbo
* Specifying the thermal range to render
* Zooming in and out
* Translated to multiple languages (English, Dutch, French, German)
* Available for Linux and Windows
